                    <nc xml:id="m-fafdf7de-00ea-4957-9c54-b7d6f98b2f69" pname="a" oct="3" />
                  </neume>
                </syllable>
                <syllable xml:id="m-289fa009-82b6-44af-8644-dc2b22ac14af">
                  <syl /><neume facs="#m-33c7d935-40a9-4884-8dbf-4500c95be16c" type="punctum" xml:id="m-e3988ac8-3db4-4692-be96-f4fcd1cbed9a">
                    <nc xml:id="m-afa6056a-5570-4e20-b5ab-e63481c71e18" pname="a" oct="3" />
                  </neume>
                </syllable>
                <syllable xml:id="m-99b248cd-dc96-4cf6-b714-c2e4ce275b0c">
                  <syl /><neume facs="#m-0b9aa1db-3ff6-4df7-bca9-75fc23990bc9" type="punctum" xml:id="m-02b9d542-4afa-4114-8391-f4d0031a1301">
                    <nc xml:id="m-418d01fd-1f27-4cb9-b451-f73498fa9cef" pname="a" oct="3" />
                  </neume>
                </syllable>
                <syllable xml:id="m-9a843e68-437f-49ed-b407-cb18da8b2c59">
                  <syl /><neume facs="#m-b44f413b-dd1b-4292-9ef6-12f6d4d7bedc" type="cavum" xml:id="m-0979bfb9-b452-4395-a31f-560f05a68ac7">
                    <nc xml:id="m-b76128c9-06a1-4253-97c8-5dfa237aa3f6" pname="g" oct="3" />
                  </neume>
                </syllable>
                <syllable xml:id="m-d413d83c-67b5-4a80-8342-9a6066bb5fd4">
                  <syl /><neume facs="#m-25b09957-f7fa-4122-bf3e-d4f9da7a1dfa" type="punctum" xml:id="m-8a253bb1-685c-4b66-b165-0f4238ea28c4">
                    <nc xml:id="m-775945e6-f0bd-454f-9618-ebe262abacd3" pname="g" oct="3">
                      <signifLet xml:id="m-7c7a5b5d-5fe8-4bbf-bfc1-c5cf44b8246e" />
                    </nc>
                  </neume>
                </syllable>
                <syllable xml:id="m-9d4b2426-9e95-46ed-8992-f40d80aab37a">
                  <syl /><neume facs="#m-6615f7b6-9cf9-4fc7-bc34-59b6d3c4db10" type="punctum" xml:id="m-6ff7cc87-d0db-4be2-bd32-160871a64526">
                    <nc xml:id="m-fecf6d26-f2e6-488d-940e-2dabc83da2b9" pname="a" oct="3" />
                  </neume>
                </syllable>
                <syllable xml:id="m-7cebcd5f-1545-4ea0-b945-36d4e8bf08b8">
                  <syl /><neume facs="#m-38a424f2-272e-4825-9853-03717eb270fc" type="punctum" xml:id="m-1a2c5afa-d37e-42fa-81f3-c341c209d8f3">
                    <nc xml:id="m-9f2bf144-9232-4333-b8c4-0b5a4d8bb700" pname="a" oct="3" />
                  </neume>
                </syllable>
                <syllable xml:id="m-6275b16f-eab0-4028-a29a-810586cd547c">
                  <syl /><neume facs="#m-897077b9-3889-4908-82eb-2b471ec1a728" type="punctum" xml:id="m-0ffe83fc-a712-4ac6-b8d9-df7030927a08">
                    <nc xml:id="m-5d571b41-4839-4a8e-a8a5-7db87897493f" pname="a" oct="3" />
                  </neume>
                </syllable>
                <divLine xml:id="m-b68d5f96-d17d-4ae9-9d1c-cdb884f19b3e" facs="#m-5d42b982-e498-45f8-b5eb-233815320614" form="finalis" />
              </layer>
            </staff>
            <div xml:id="m-792a030e-67b8-4e68-9751-afc1a3e6ffef">
              <lg xml:id="m-795c9728-6a50-4239-bd8c-70fe886f823e">
                <l xml:id="m-4fe9d6c4-61c0-4899-a1cb-73c577599d9b" facs="#m-2994880c-44dc-447f-ba58-aa89dbe7f410" label="ambiguous">388</l><l xml:id="m-c8e425d1-86be-4b4d-90a8-736703f0f5b3" facs="#m-3a3ccd15-e869-4e84-a8f6-15ecb4c936b9" label="text-like">The Nativity of Our Lord.</l><l xml:id="m-57dc9d00-6770-43ec-9a9d-99e8a7313975" facs="#m-f879c410-a6b1-4b59-90c6-da6898a189c2" label="lyrics-like">9. Commoveátur a fácie éjus univérsa térra: * dícite in Géntibus</l><l xml:id="m-617a4c7e-bd6f-4698-9050-ff2eb5a36996" facs="#m-45b76e03-ea19-4a7f-9354-a69e84710d6f" label="lyrics-like">quia Dóminus regnávit.</l><l xml:id="m-4831d5da-7f55-438c-a601-1939a0740861" facs="#m-3f3dd29e-5e18-40f9-8fb7-b394858c1f76" label="lyrics-like">10. Etenim corréxit órbem térrae, qui non commovébitur:*judicábit</l><l xml:id="m-c1bec071-109c-4d82-8a33-839bd34377f8" facs="#m-28a58077-ac78-4f58-a297-e85548ed89d4" label="lyrics-like">pópulos in aequitâte.</l><l xml:id="m-7356c920-c6ed-49ba-913f-0524b589265f" facs="#m-c1f4ebef-4d99-4451-ae90-2ef6fe23cb87" label="lyrics-like">11. Laeténtur caéli, et exsúltet térra: t commoveátur máre, et</l><l xml:id="m-bbb2d944-c9c9-4935-8e38-960097c5424b" facs="#m-3b1379dd-c2d3-42a2-8dd2-61fe5a16e782" label="lyrics-like">plenitúdo éjus : “ gaudébunt cámpi, et ómnia quae in eis sunt</l><l xml:id="m-6368ca0b-e995-437e-8a51-f0d92bbcb796" facs="#m-0d09d871-1ad8-49dc-96f9-6f9287327630" label="lyrics-like">12. Tunc exsultábunt ómnia ligna silvárum a fácie Dómini, quia</l><l xml:id="m-988103a0-ed74-4af3-a6c0-62d7f0dd75f5" facs="#m-87d369c3-a93f-4986-87c9-fc4dac71199a" label="lyrics-like">vénit: * quóniam vénit judicare térram.</l><l xml:id="m-171272f9-39a3-4780-b07b-8b8eb86bd90f" facs="#m-71668881-2b0d-47a2-935a-405ecd708363" label="lyrics-like">13. Judicábit órbem térrae in dequitâte, * et pópulos in veritâte súa.</l><l xml:id="m-ea53583e-2402-44e2-a95f-a04f1739ec8c" facs="#m-c6c2b70d-c71c-4f78-9573-b29e05940a5f" label="lyrics-like">14. Glória Pá̂tri, et Filio, * et Spiritui Sáncto.</l><l xml:id="m-42bfbe31-195d-49ad-9423-72bf96fbf33f" facs="#m-ecdd49e2-7bbc-45ca-ab9b-ac0c247fdb1f" label="lyrics-like">15. Sicut érat in princípio, et nunc, et sémper, * et in saécula saecu¬</l><l xml:id="m-40986841-b57a-4003-910a-a548c00289f7" facs="#m-60d3cf85-17b0-4747-b6e0-7d7a9a65953c" label="lyrics-like">tórum. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-41a35fd7-fd18-4363-99b8-a9861c8d7b2d" facs="#m-323a6a13-5496-45ed-adce-1d9dea3ffd2e" label="ambiguous">s. Ant.</l><l xml:id="m-6c36c864-ba5c-4c6d-ba2d-0f20cefda37c" facs="#m-41489ce4-57c8-409a-ab84-ba44afb0f901" label="ambiguous">G.F</l><l xml:id="m-ffb7b651-944b-4a82-80a1-4c80930cc881" facs="#m-11287903-f88a-4a81-a0ae-02e8733fda17" label="lyrics-like">Otum fé-cit Dóminus, “alle-lú-ia, sa-lu-tà-re sú-um,</l><l xml:id="m-5f3938e2-07fc-48b0-a5ba-d061e5df5787" facs="#m-688755d4-a1c0-4c29-97f3-80085076e969" label="lyrics-like">alle-lú-ia.</l><l xml:id="m-9c147ff9-9b14-44ed-accb-633c822f7a86" facs="#m-5acc8d4b-8c81-4bf9-89a6-010ad0757d44" label="ambiguous">Psalm 97.</l><l xml:id="m-8a05bfd2-9e2a-462a-bfe4-8658be8372bc" facs="#m-015f219d-9665-4a18-a344-82c8a229cc2d" label="lyrics-like">1. Cantá-te Dómino cánticum nó¬ vum:“qui-a mi-rabí-li-a</l><l xml:id="m-48a97e51-9e27-490a-8511-37e2a430a7bf" facs="#m-f4f77489-5abb-4e10-87fa-5d0fb5b95963" label="lyrics-like">fé- cit. Flex : régis Dómi-ni:</l><l xml:id="m-8404149d-b7a4-4fd5-afe6-08e920a8d9e8" facs="#m-882521ae-a5ff-4ba4-878d-461abdc93481" label="lyrics-like">2. Salvávit sibi déxtera éjus:“et bráchium sánctum éjus.</l><l xml:id="m-2331d20f-ca5e-44c8-af64-15d029698f1e" facs="#m-40f0bbb1-a0e5-4581-a591-5d4dca4c8ba7" label="lyrics-like">3. Nótum fécit Dóminus salutáre sûum: * in conspéctu Géntium</l><l xml:id="m-3cdf4eb6-8d0c-45a9-b89a-4f48c29683b7" facs="#m-cc04a3ef-9a99-403b-b56e-4f73608037a1" label="lyrics-like">revelávit justitiam súam.</l><l xml:id="m-53d7f23a-a6e6-40db-aa6e-56542ebd12a9" facs="#m-b136f4ec-8039-46cd-8b35-6007b7fc723a" label="lyrics-like">4. Recordátus est misericórdice súae, “et veritátis súae dómui Israel.</l><l xml:id="m-36caba7d-c502-4f73-b480-bea07abd3bf2" facs="#m-7fccdc27-30f7-43db-b7b5-4a15a1a5822d" label="lyrics-like">5. Vidérunt ómnes términi tèrrae * salutáre Déi nóstri.</l><l xml:id="m-86bb3f12-bc3e-4d71-ae51-ba0e85cb32b3" facs="#m-d0044ab0-bc5f-419a-926e-41f258e1566b" label="lyrics-like">6. Jubiláte Déo, ómnts térra: “ cantáte, et exsultáte, et psállite.</l><l xml:id="m-58a5390d-e98a-4d70-9d96-0e38a194e9d6" facs="#m-68c41021-c551-48ef-8eb1-fa62393c5a79" label="lyrics-like">7. Psállite Dómino in cithara, in cithara et vóce psálmi:“in túbis</l><l xml:id="m-1d8bc6c5-667b-40e9-ac6d-df4310ad7365" facs="#m-500bfe23-662b-4e43-b10b-339f8db62541" label="lyrics-like">ductilibus, et vóce túbae córneae.</l><l xml:id="m-3b440156-8cb8-4a34-8af7-447fd7d490e7" facs="#m-187876bf-a02d-4828-bf37-f4ca1979eb81" label="lyrics-like">8. Jubiláte in conspéctu régis Dómini: t moveátur máre, et pleni¬</l><l xml:id="m-566dec3a-f01a-4f8f-98c8-47c2bc5598c3" facs="#m-5e89adb0-1b27-4575-b4bb-015f468cb32b" label="lyrics-like">túdo éjus:“órbis terrárum, et qui hábitant in éo.</l><l xml:id="m-27c319a5-5b91-4e9c-a176-c08974409e1c" facs="#m-b4594342-04e5-448a-8a97-8c33e833d6ca" label="lyrics-like">9. Flúmina pláudent mánu, t simul móntes exsultábunt a conspéctu</l><l xml:id="m-0ecf5e12-ea36-46cb-8cd3-32f9e846ec6b" facs="#m-a5922895-d4ed-413f-818f-d1a0ef53b5d5" label="lyrics-like">Dómini:* quóniam vénit judicare térram.</l><l xml:id="m-6765932b-6ee4-42fa-a0c1-11b821b5d8b7" facs="#m-a1d7e59d-fda5-468b-9a75-7641945d1eb3" label="lyrics-like">10. Judicábit órbem terrárum in justitia, “et pópulos in aequitâte.</l><l xml:id="m-7ea2939e-534d-4766-ae64-25004b83e53c" facs="#m-859ceef5-2b2f-4e93-8221-819552472190" label="lyrics-like">11. Glória Pátri, et Filio,“et Spiritai Sáncto.</l><l xml:id="m-2b051c06-5cae-4caa-91be-652a0f147819" facs="#m-8cc0809b-f01e-4869-9a31-49cf60ebd9bf" label="lyrics-like">12. Sicut érat in princípio, et nunc, et sémper, * et in saécula saecu¬</l><l xml:id="m-e9d1fee7-db48-4305-b3c1-23e6bf6d5384" facs="#m-83c30cae-a096-43fb-b355-8791c65decba" label="lyrics-like">tórum. Amen.</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>